Hi Adrian,

An approach that would require some experience with the rethinking package <https://github.com/rmcelreath/rethinking> on your part, but with interesting abilities for interpretation, etc. is to use the spatial autocorrelation model presented in the package vignettes <https://github.com/rmcelreath/rethinking#gaussian-process>  (and discussed a bit more in the book), which incorporates your pairwise distance matrix into your model.

Sacha

