Hey Corey,

I've done it previously by creating a plot that just has the axes/axes labels and then plot_grid with that. As far as I know, it'll take whatever you throw at it and align. So just make your grid of 6, and then nest a y-axis in its own plot on the left in another plot_grid. (i.e. plot_grid within a plot_grid within a plot_grid...) Hacky, but it works.

Others might chime in with their (better?) suggestions.

Cheers!

John

