I forgot to mention in my previous response that you can also avoid the need for the layout matrix by nesting a call to arrangeGrob (which works like grid.arrange but returns a new grob without printing it). For example:

grid.arrange(grobs=c(plots[1:5], list(arrangeGrob(grobs=plots[6:7], ncol=1))), ncol=3)

